                 quantify the consequence of these perturbations on the marine
                 ecosystem. This interdisciplinary Inria Challenge project aims at developing
                 new AI and mathematical modeling tools to contribute to the understanding of the structure, functioning, and underlying mechanisms and dynamics of the global ocean symbiome. These actions are essential to gain a better understanding of the oceans
